<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A LAND USE SHAPEFILE IS USUALLY CREATED FROM SATELLITE IMAGE CLASSIFICATION, AND LATER REFINED USING TOPOGRAPHIC SURVEYS, CADASTRAL INFORMATION, OR OFFICIAL GOVERNMENT DATASETS. IT REPRESENTS HOW THE LAND IS BEING USED: RESIDENTIAL AREAS, COMMERCIAL ZONES, INDUSTRIAL SITES, GREEN SPACES, FORESTS, AGRICULTURE, AND SO ON.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [8]
>>
