134 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (IT IS IMPORTANT FOR URBAN PLANNING, ENVIRONMENTAL MANAGEMENT, AND DECISION-MAKING. IT HELPS CITIES UNDERSTAND HOW SPACE IS ORGANIZED \(WHERE GREEN AREAS ARE LACKING, AND HOW URBAN EXPANSION IS HAPPENING...\). WHEN COMBINED WITH ADMINISTRATIVE UNITS SUCH AS NEIGHBORHOODS, WE CAN DESCRIBE SPATIAL PATTERNS AND COMPARE SOCIO-ENVIRONMENTAL DIFFERENCES WITHIN THE CITY.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [9]
>>
